### ti-ai-question-ui — manual API testing directly against ti-document-worker
### Requires ti-document-worker running standalone on :8086 (see README "Run as a standalone
### microservice"). Paths here are unprefixed — as seen by the service itself, without the
### gateway's leading "/document" segment.

@worker = http://localhost:8086

### Upload a document file — starts async ETL (embeddings + text sections)
POST {{worker}}/rest/v1/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="java.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./java.pdf
--WebAppBoundary--

###

### Load a document from a URL — starts the same async ETL pipeline
POST {{worker}}/rest/v1/load-url
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/spring-boot.pdf"
}

###

### Health check
GET {{worker}}/rest/v1/version
Accept: text/plain

###
